Package: curl
Version: @DEB_CURL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Networking
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://curl.se/
Depends: libcurl4 (= @DEB_CURL_V@)
Description: command line URL transfer tool
 curl is a command-line tool for transferring data with URL syntax. This build
 uses OpenSSL and includes HTTP/2, IDN, PSL, Brotli, and zstd support while
 omitting SSH, RTMP, c-ares, and HTTP/3 backends.
